OL,3,GNEWSAEngland's mayors to be given power
OL,4,Ato introduce tourist tax
OL,5,
OL,6,FMayors in England are set to be given
OL,7,Fthe power to introduce an overnight
OL,8,Fvisitor levy on tourists, under plans
OL,9,Fbeing announced by the government
OL,10,Flater.
OL,12,FLocal leaders would be allowed to bring
OL,13,Fin an uncapped levy, dubbed a "tourist
OL,14,Ftax", as a percentage of the cost of
OL,15,Faccommodation rather than a flat fee.
OL,17,FHospitality leaders have warned "jobs
OL,18,Fare now at risk" because of the
OL,19,Fproposals and that families holidaying
OL,20,Fin England would feel the pinch.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
